completed_at: "2026-09-19T09:41:40.397Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "validate emits a fix hint for closed items missing closed_at; auto-fix (new timestamps fix-scope) populates closed_at solely from history-replay evidence and is idempotent; items with unrecoverable history land on a documented residual list with counts; changelog regenerated in the same commit as the bulk pass shows zero unintended [Unreleased] churn"
parent: pm-33cw
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Add opt-in timestamps repair scope, verified lifecycle replay, bounded residual diagnostics, locked stale-plan revalidation, public SDK primitives, CLI discovery and documentation; apply the complete proven repository backfill."
expected_result: "Recover only proven missing terminal closure dates, preserve existing dates and history, converge idempotently, and retain historical release attribution."
actual_result: "1488 applied, zero failed or unresolved; rerun finds zero missing dates. All histories verify; 2463 historical changelog memberships unchanged. 9057 tests pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, full static gates and real temporary/packed npm and Bun acceptance pass."
